5fca9bb2740","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"950ed7d10ebecfb84d47c07c67be5c5555b04e8cf79952f703fed106e6706f77","logical_entry_identity":"2b9801a6bd6120bfcb552066b18f3e4d9645a053746643e6c96cf37c26b78233","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A huge and heavily-scarred orc with a gigantic sword. His helm is fashioned from a dragon's skull.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个手持巨剑的高大兽人，浑身伤疤。他的头盔由龙的头骨制成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b9c8bb9fae92b0ab78ad689f41d4af6d5c6744a3c2f7b42a91c6f030145f4321","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"951122f8d8e5175550f45be467040add722e7897191df4cd42e96d525273f6a1","logical_entry_identity":"ede16440f87159d365e9bfb8dedf82e266d3878c1e496925ffc37cde7de29d62","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The sandworms are gone, devoured by this shrieking, warped horror.","source_tag":"_t","target":"沙虫们已经死了，它们被这只扭曲的恐怖所吞噬。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3f9ecd869beba6c94b002b82f8f62ddddae6cecbee32e837951c81ff000915ae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"951300593223f4ad4e652828a10a9771d90431da4d8e91371cb9bffcd9fff8cb","logical_entry_identity":"310427036df799638c7ca7a9156c49e2152db0f9e6e89586c2495449d63bca86","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A furious ice storm rages around the user doing %0.2f cold damage in a radius of 3 each turn for %d turns.\n\t\tIt has 25%% chance to freeze damaged targets.\n\t\tThe damage and duration will increase with your Willpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"一阵激烈的冰风暴环绕施法者造成每回合 %0.2f 冰冷伤害，有效范围 3 码，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t有 25%% 几率使受伤害目标被冰冻。\n\t\t受意志影响，伤害和持续时间有额外加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8308b91ec5d2c18ed414fbe5c9d11ab68c53344efd8333cbe538c833c8241b2d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"951302f398defc2ec78d92258a7bae8e9a797278fd0500c6eb58fe1ef871e642","logical_entry_identity":"25ffe7ad6371ce0e7c61cc38ed3b1dc8261845fed2978821cd53af25622a4b72","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"In ToME4 a character's power depends on her/his level: players can get up to level 50.\n\nEach level brings more life and resources (like stamina, mana, etc.) and different kinds of points that can improve your character:\n* #GOLD#Stat points#WHITE#: They allow you to raise the six main stats: Strength, Dexterity, Magic, Willpower, Cunning and Constitution. You get 3 points per level.\n* #GOLD#Class talent points#WHITE#: Class talents define the core functions of your class. You gain 1 point every level, plus 1 extra point on multiples of 5.\n* #GOLD#Generic talent points#WHITE#: Generic talents provide utility and/or more power, but are not always specific to your class. You gain 1 point on levels that aren't multiples of 5.\n* #GOLD#Category talent points#WHITE#: They allow you to improve your mastery of a talent category (increasing the power of all talents inside) or to learn a new talent category.\n\nLevels are gained when experience reaches 100%. You gain experience from killing a hostile creature whose level is similar to yours.\n\nTo open the character levelup screen either press 'p' or right-click on yourself and choose 'Levelup'.\n\nNow open the levelup screen and assign your points.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"在ToME4中角色的能力取决于他/她的人物等级：角色最高可以升级至50级。\n\n每升一级你会获得更多的生命值和其他能量值（比如体力、法力等等）。另外还能获得\n不同的点数来提升你的角色。\n* #GOLD#属性点数#WHITE#：允许你提升6个主要属性：力量、敏捷、魔力、意志、灵巧和体质。每等级你能获\n得3个点数。\n* #GOLD#职业技能点数#WHITE#：职业技能是你的职业的核心能力，每升一级获得1点，每5级额外获得1点。\n* #GOLD#通用技能点数#WHITE#：通用技能是非职业限定的一些角色提升技能，在等级不是 5 的倍数时，你每升一级获得 1 点。\n* #GOLD#技能树解锁点#WHITE#：可以提高你对某一技能树内所有技能的掌握程度，或者也可以解锁一个新的技能树。\n\n每当你的经验值获得达到100%时你就升级了。你可以通过杀死和你等级差不多的怪物\n来获得经验值。\n\n按下 'p' 键，或者右键点击你自己并选择“升级”，即可打开升级面板。\n\n现在，打开你的升级面板，进行升级操作。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"45243e3860630e74a5ec1e9525473753b2366cf88feaf3768c12902ee2d865e7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"95136da9ad6443b2780d9340c65a72f59f4f98b06d7a2c2d6d1cc1a193366314","logical_entry_identity":"a43c6be4b968a43d48a3b5faf65fa0d3ecca4f1edd23fe85e892d494d59b7ae2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":