rget":"蠕虫行走"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0aa358879cdd14e0ccc372828363abe12515e67bb9b828be046e8e3357577ee6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"951bd717cf2bfd07a30f167a37da846736a6e826209004c10256d3ae4f799eb5","logical_entry_identity":"0bcfc9bab7e340862b8b1b70b6bd32e621da9f2c0e95c5c0b73cbb8db8fc3e23","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Even now, something compels you to sing.\n\t\t\tDirge of Famine: Increases health regen by %d.\n\t\t\tDirge of Conquest: Gives you part of a turn on critical (10%%) or kill (%d%%).\n\t\t\tDirge of Pestilence: Shields you for %d when an enemy inflicts a detrimental effect on you (5 turn cooldown).\n\t\t\tYou may only have one Dirge active at a time.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"每时每刻，都有什么驱使着你歌唱。\n\t\t\t饥荒挽歌：增加生命回复 %d。\n\t\t\t征服挽歌：给予你暴击时 10%% 回合或杀戮时 %d%% 回合的时间。\n\t\t\t瘟疫挽歌：敌人对你造成负面效果时获得 %d 的护盾（5 回合冷却）。\n\t\t\t你同时只能激活一种挽歌。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3d0a463a7e5c8f6ecbbd5b0f5d420e46e1469ba2b2782bdd2d77bbab078bfbf6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9520c240f8cbe3685b76683e2486c75e479e5884ee736aee3ee895e3c8f89072","logical_entry_identity":"f551256517b98b188ada7a4abd78e7572b3a5c77125f3c11aee9c33ab4b3a3db","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#VIOLET#Zemekkys starts to draw runes on the floor using the athame and gem dust.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#VIOLET#泽梅基斯开始用仪式匕首和宝石粉末在地板上绘制符文。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140"}}